    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuclear PS0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 1 步：基线。`mamuprep PS1` = 本人装立牌(stand)+骰子(dice)+主手铁剑并清两张专属牌/效果/锁存/强制冷却；`mamuprep PS2 Bot1` = 给 Bot1 装立牌(后面的「另一名佩戴者发牌」相位需要 Bot1 佩戴；`bot_stand=1` 是立牌真进了 bot curios stand 槽的回读证据)。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuprep PS1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1300 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuprep PS2 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1500 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 2 步：觉醒计数（§2.1 / 裁决 1）。\n  · `A0 set 0` 归零；\n  · `A1 add 0` = 探针直接调产品 `onCardGivenToOther(自己, 自己)`（giver == receiver）⇒ 期望 **+0**（`how=self_self`、`delta=0`、`delta_ok=1`）；\n  · `B1 cap Bot1` = 佩戴者把 Bot1 记为受益人（只走计数入口、不发牌）⇒ 期望 **+1**（`self_delta=1`），且逐受益人差值串里 b1 的**觉醒**增量为 0（被计入的是发牌者，不是收牌者 —— 这条同时是「受益人自身觉醒不被改动」的负控）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuawake A0 set 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuawake A1 add 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubatch B1 cap Bot1 - -", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 3 步：**按受益人去重**（同一人 2 张只 +1）。`A2 set 0` 归零后 `B2 twice Bot1`：同一事件内对**同一受益人**连发 2 张专属牌 ⇒ 期望 `self=0>1:self_delta=1`（只 +1），而 `byself=[g1:0>1:1,g2:1>1:0]` 直接给出「第一张 +1、第二张 +0」；同时 `bot1_inv_delta=2` 证明**牌真的发了 2 张**（计数去重不是「没发」）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuawake A2 set 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubatch B2 twice Bot1 - -", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1200 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 4 步：**单次封顶 3（上界命中）**。`A3 set 0` 后 `B3 three Bot1 Bot2 Bot3`：一次事件内 3 名不同受益人 ⇒ 期望恰好 +3（这是封顶的**上界**证据）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuawake A3 set 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubatch B3 three Bot1 Bot2 Bot3", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 4b 步：**单次封顶 3（第 4 人被挡下）** —— 只靠 `three` 无法区分「有封顶」与「无封顶」（两者都是 +3），必须再来一名受益人。先 spawn 第 4 只 bot，再 `A4 set 0` + `B4 four Bot1 Bot2 Bot3`：一次事件内 4 名不同受益人 ⇒ 期望 `self_delta` **仍为 3**（若封顶失效则为 4），且差值串有 4 行 `b4`（`hit` 对第 4 人照常调用、只是加层被挡）。相位结束立刻 kill Bot4，使后续相位的现场回到三只 bot。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot4 kill", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot4 spawn at ~ ~ ~-3", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1800 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/clear Bot4", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuawake A4 set 0", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubatch B4 four Bot1 Bot2 Bot3", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot4 kill", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 5 步：**佩戴者给他人发牌 +1**（`mamugive` = 产品 `giveExclusiveCard` → 唯一漏斗 `VitaminPillChipItem#giveCard(giver,receiver,card)` → `onCardGivenToOther`）。\n  · 先把 Bot2 拉回干净态（`mamuprep PS3 Bot2` ⇒ 清 Bot2 的两张专属牌与 curios 槽 ⇒ `recv_any_before=0`）；\n  · `G0 set 0 Bot1` 把发牌者的觉醒归零；\n  · `G1` ⇒ 发牌者 +1、收牌者背包多 1 张撕咬；`G2`（下一 tick，新事件）⇒ 再 +1（`giver_awk=1>2`）+ Bot2 的撕咬累计为 2。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuprep PS3 Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1500 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuawake G0 set 0 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamugive G1 Bot1 Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1000 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamugive G2 Bot1 Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1000 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 5b 步：另一名佩戴者发牌（`mamubatch other`：发牌者 = Bot1、受益人 = Bot2）。`OB0 set 0 Bot1` 归零后 ⇒ 期望 `byself=[b1:0>1:1]`（Bot1 的觉醒 +1）而**本人 `self_delta=0`**（本人不是发牌者，也不是受益人）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuawake OB0 set 0 Bot1", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubatch BA other Bot1 Bot2", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1000 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 6 步：**非佩戴者发牌不计**。构造面选择说明：探针没有「清掉某只 bot 的 curios stand 槽」的入口（`mamuprep <tag> <bot>` 是唯一能碰 bot 饰品的命令，而它**总是装上立牌**；bot 的 curios 又跨用例持久 ⇒ 用 bot 当「无立牌发牌者」这条路的**前置不可控**，`mamubatch nosign` 因此在本环境不可信）。\n⇒ 改用**可控**的等价构造：`mamuclear PS4` 清空**本人**的 stand 槽（同时把觉醒/锁存归零、移除真龙效果、清两张专属牌与骰子），随后 `PS4R SIGNLESS` 先把前置读出来（`sign=0:awk=0:df=0`），再由**本人这个无立牌者**当发牌者跑 `BZ cap Bot1`：产品的 `onCardGivenToOther` 首行 `if (!isEquipped(giver)) return;` ⇒ 期望 `self=0>0:self_delta=0`。\n（`mamubatch nosign` 档本身的语义未被本用例覆盖，如实登记在下方的未覆盖清单里。）" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuclear PS4", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuread PS4R SIGNLESS", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubatch BZ cap Bot1 - -", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 7 步：撕咬（§2.6 / 裁决 2、4）。先 `mamuprep PS5` 复位（**必须**重新装立牌：`dragon` 档的 `df` 判据要求立牌在 stand 槽；骰子也必须在 dice 槽，装配项写在骰子组件上）。`mamubite` 每档内部一次性完成：写装配项 → 给骰神赐福(6000 tick) → 驱动一次产品 tick → 读 ap/latch → 调 `onDiceBlessingTriggered`(真实挂点入口) → 再读 → **清掉装配栏的撕咬**（模拟耐久 1 被消耗）→ 读回。\n  · `BT1 light`：1 张撕咬 ⇒ `awk 0→1`、`latch 0→1`、`ap` +min(1,4)=1、**消耗后 latch 仍 1 且 ap 不变**（锁存的核心判据：不锁存则同一击内加成即失效）；\n  · `BT2 three`：3 张一次触发 ⇒ `awk_delta=3`（裁决 2：不受「给他人发牌」的 3 层封顶约束）、`ap` +3；\n  · `BT3 dragon`：觉醒先置 7 + 1 张 ⇒ 8 层并**立即**真龙（`df 0→1`、`df_on_ok=1`、`fx_d_on=1`），`ap_delta=9`（撕咬 4 + 形态 5）、`ap_cap_delta=4`（= min(8,4)，撕咬那部分的封顶）、`ap_df_bonus=5`（形态跃迁那一拍叠加的 `DRAGON_FORM_ATTACK_BONUS`）、`ap_expect=9` ⇒ **`ap_cap_ok=1` 且 `ap_ok=1`**（2026-09-27 修正：旧口径只拿「撕咬部分」比 ⇒ `dragon` 档必然 `ap_cap_ok=0`，那是读数口径缺陷；现在 `ap_expect` 把形态 +5 显式算入）。\n  ⚠️ 「min(觉醒,4) 实时」在本探针里只能靠**三个不同觉醒值各读一次**取证（1/3/8 ⇒ 1/3/4），无法在同一赐福内改层数后再读 —— 该更强形态的判据登记为未覆盖。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuprep PS5", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1300 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubite BT1 light", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1600 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubite BT2 three", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1600 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamubite BT3 dragon", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1600 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 7b 步：**0 张 ⇒ 无加成**的基线读数（`mamuprep PS6` 清掉两张专属牌并把锁存置 false）⇒ `PS6R NOBITE` 必须 `bite_latch=0:inv_bite=0:inv_roar=0`。说明：加成的**数值**缺席需要一个「基准 ap」读数来对照，探针没有该字段 ⇒ 本条只作前提取证，数值对照登记为未覆盖。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuprep PS6", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1300 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuread PS6R NOBITE", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },

    { "op": "note", "text": "第 8 步：收尾（bot 全部退出 + 探针全清）。" },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuclear PS9", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot1 kill", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot2 kill", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot3 kill", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 1200 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/player Bot4 kill", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 700 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/kill @e[type=!player,distance=..64]", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 },
    { "op": "inject_command", "command": "/astralprobe mamuclear PSZ", "no_esc": true },
    { "op": "wait", "ms": 900 }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_PS0_MU_CLEAR:cleared=1" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_PS1_MU_PREP:sign_err=:dice_err=:bot=-:online=" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_PS2_MU_PREP:sign_err=:dice_err=[^:]*:bot=Bot1:bot_clear=ok:bot_sign=ok:bot_dice=ok:bot_stand=1:online=" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_A0_AWAKE:mode=set:want=0:who=self:how=set:awk=[0-9-]+>0:delta=[0-9-]+:delta_ok=1" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_A1_AWAKE:mode=add:want=0:who=self:how=self_self:awk=([0-9]+)>\\1:delta=0:delta_ok=1" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_B1_BATCH:mode=cap:self=[0-9-]+>1:self_delta=1:self_any=[0-9-]+:byself=\\[b1:[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:0\\]" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_B2_BATCH:mode=twice:self=[0-9-]+>1:self_delta=1:self_any=[0-9-]+:byself=\\[g1:[0-9-]+>1:1,g2:1>1:0\\]:[^\\n]*:bot1_inv_delta=2" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_B3_BATCH:mode=three:self=[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:self_delta=3:self_any=[0-9-]+:byself=\\[b1:[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:0,b2:[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:0,b3:[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:0\\]" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_B4_BATCH:mode=four:self=[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:self_delta=3:self_any=[0-9-]+:byself=\\[b1:[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:0,b2:[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:0,b3:[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:0,b4:[0-9-]+>[0-9-]+:0\\]" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_B4_BATCH:[^\\n]*:online=[^:]*[Bb]ot4" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_G1_MU_GIVE:giver=Bot1:receiver=Bot2:giver_eq=1:giver_awk=[0-9-]+>1:giver_delta=1:recv_any_before=0:recv_any_after=1:recv_bite=1" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_G2_MU_GIVE:giver=Bot1:receiver=Bot2:giver_eq=1:giver_awk=1>2:giver_delta=1:recv_any_before=1:recv_any_after=1:recv_bite=2" },
    { "type": "log", "source": "latest", "pattern": "AP_BA_BATCH:mode=other:self=([0-9-]+)>\\1:self_delta=0:self_any=[0-9-]+:byself=\\[b1:0>1:1\\]" },
